### Strict dashboard isolation

Ordinary users can access only their own private user records.

Artists can access only their own artist profiles and records for which they have verified active authorization.

Artist team permissions must be explicitly checked.

Administrators can access only records allowed by their assigned permissions.

Master Admin has platform-level administrative authority, but that must not silently grant ordinary private artist-dashboard membership.

Test all cross-user and cross-artist access paths.

